TEST ONLY: public self-signed certificate and private key for local TLS fixtures.
Never use this key in a deployment. Valid for provider.test and public.test.
Generated with:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey ec -pkeyopt ec_paramgen_curve:P-256 -nodes \
    -days 36500 -subj /CN=provider.test \
    -addext 'subjectAltName=DNS:provider.test,DNS:public.test' \
    -addext 'keyUsage=critical,digitalSignature,keyCertSign' \
    -addext 'extendedKeyUsage=serverAuth' -out cert.pem -keyout key.pem
This file concatenates cert.pem and key.pem; tests need no openssl executable.

